---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions — Nuclear VPS" description="Read the terms and conditions governing use of Nuclear VPS services.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-hero py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <span class="section-tag">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-black text-4xl text-text-h mt-3">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted mt-3">Last updated: January 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="bg-base py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          By accessing or using the Nuclear VPS website and services, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you may not access our services. These terms apply to all visitors, users, and customers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">2. Services</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          Nuclear VPS provides Virtual Private Server (VPS) hosting and dedicated server services optimised for Forex trading. Our services include:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Trading VPS plans (Bronze, Silver, Gold) hosted in our New York data centre.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Trading Server plans (Server 7700, Server 7950X3D) for high-performance requirements.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>24/7 technical support via support ticket system.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Daily backups and service management via client dashboard.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of our services at any time with reasonable notice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">3. Accounts & Registration</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">To use our services you must:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Be at least 18 years of age.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Provide accurate, complete, and current registration information.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Maintain the security of your account credentials. You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Notify us immediately of any unauthorised use of your account.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          One person or entity may not maintain more than one account. We reserve the right to terminate accounts that violate these terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">4. Billing & Payments</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-text-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Billing Cycles:</strong> Services are billed Monthly, Quarterly, or Annually as selected at order. Prices shown are in USD.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Auto-renewal:</strong> Subscriptions paid by card or PayPal renew automatically. You will receive an invoice email before renewal. You may cancel at any time from your dashboard.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Payment Methods:</strong> We accept Credit/Debit Cards (via Stripe), PayPal, and Cryptocurrency (via Coinbase Commerce). Cryptocurrency payments are non-refundable once confirmed on-chain.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Late Payment:</strong> If a payment fails, you will receive a notice and have 7 days to update your payment method. Failure to pay will result in service suspension and may lead to termination and data deletion.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Price Changes:</strong> We reserve the right to change prices with 30 days' notice. Price changes will not affect active billing cycles already paid for.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Coupon Codes:</strong> Discount coupons are applied at checkout. Only one coupon may be used per order. Coupons cannot be applied retroactively.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">5. Refund Policy</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-text-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">No Refunds:</strong> All payments are non-refundable. Once a service has been activated, we do not offer refunds, partial refunds, or credits for unused time.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Cryptocurrency:</strong> Payments made via cryptocurrency are non-refundable under any circumstances.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">6. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">You agree NOT to use our VPS services for:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Any illegal activity under applicable local, national, or international law.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Sending spam, bulk unsolicited emails, or operating mail servers without prior approval.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Hosting malware, viruses, ransomware, or any malicious software.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>DDoS attacks, port scanning, network intrusion, or any attack on third-party infrastructure.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Mining cryptocurrency without explicit written approval.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Hosting illegal content including but not limited to child sexual abuse material.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Reselling or sub-leasing VPS resources without prior written agreement.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Any activity that excessively strains shared infrastructure or degrades performance for other customers.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">Violation of this policy will result in immediate service termination without refund and may be reported to law enforcement.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">7. Service Level Agreement (SLA)</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-text-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Uptime Guarantee:</strong> We guarantee 99.9% monthly uptime for VPS and server services, measured at the hypervisor level. Scheduled maintenance windows are excluded.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">SLA Credits:</strong> If uptime falls below 99.9% in a given month, eligible customers may request a service credit of 5% of monthly fee per hour of excess downtime, capped at 30% of the monthly fee. Credits must be requested within 30 days and will be added to account balance.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Exclusions:</strong> The SLA does not cover downtime caused by: customer actions or software, force majeure events, third-party service failures (internet routing, DNS), or scheduled maintenance with 24+ hour notice.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">8. Affiliate Programme</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-text-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
          <p>Participation in our affiliate programme is subject to these additional terms:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Commission of 15% is paid on all payments received from referred customers for the lifetime of their account.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Self-referrals (referring your own account) are prohibited and will result in programme termination.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Commissions are held for 30 days after payment to account for refunds before becoming available for withdrawal.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Withdrawals are processed within 5 business days of approval via PayPal.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>Minimum withdrawal amount is $50 USD.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-1">•</span> <span>We reserve the right to modify commission rates with 30 days' notice.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">9. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          The Nuclear VPS website, logo, and all content (text, graphics, interfaces, code) are owned by or licensed to Nuclear VPS. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works without our written consent. Use of our trademarks in affiliate marketing requires compliance with our brand guidelines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">10. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          Our services are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or completely secure.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          Nuclear VPS is not a financial services provider and accepts no liability for trading losses or missed trades resulting from VPS performance, internet connectivity issues, or any other factor.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, Nuclear VPS shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including but not limited to loss of profits, trading losses, data loss, or business interruption, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          Our total cumulative liability to you for any claim arising from or relating to these terms or our services shall not exceed the total amount paid by you in the 3 months preceding the claim.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">12. Termination</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-text-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">By You:</strong> You may cancel your account at any time from the dashboard. Cancellation stops future billing; data is retained for 90 days before deletion.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">By Us:</strong> We may suspend or terminate your account immediately for violation of these terms, non-payment after the grace period, or if required by law. We will make reasonable effort to notify you before termination unless the violation is severe.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-text-h">Effect of Termination:</strong> All rights granted under these terms cease immediately. Data may be deleted 90 days after termination. Financial records are retained as required by law.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">13. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes arising from these terms or use of our services shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">14. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Significant changes will be communicated via email to your registered address and/or a notice on our website at least 14 days before taking effect. Your continued use of our services after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl text-text-h">15. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">For questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us:</p>
        <p class="text-coral font-heading font-bold">legal@nuclearvps.com</p>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Or open a support ticket from your dashboard with department "Billing".</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
